-- B-NEW-43 Phase 2 chunk 7 (2026-05-23): Initial seed data for config tables.
--
-- Companion to 2026-04-22-initial-schema.sql. That file (pg_dump --schema-only)
-- captures the schema but NOT the data — module_constants seed rows that
-- staging accumulated through B65 / B67 / B68 / B72 / B74 / B79 / B-NEW-* and
-- the screener_filters config rows are NOT in the schema dump. On a fresh CI
-- Postgres the tables exist but are empty; getCachedNumberRequired calls hit
-- "required row missing" for every module-constant key. This file fills that
-- gap.
--
-- Source: pg_dump --data-only --no-owner --no-privileges --column-inserts
--         --table=public.module_constants --table=public.screener_filters
--         against staging Supabase (PG 17.6), 2026-05-23.
-- Cleaned: stripped psql meta-commands (backslash-restrict / -unrestrict).
