-- Contents:
--   - public.module_constants: 541 rows across module_name in {trailing_exit,
--     dbs_calculation, drift_detector, cost_geometry, position_sizing,
--     governance_modes, strategy.*, regime_classifier, b67_*, b68_*, b72_*,
--     b79_*, b_new_*, ...}.
--   - public.screener_filters: 58 rows across mode in {paper, live} and
--     asset_class in {crypto_spot, xstock_spot, xstock_perp}.
--
-- Staging coordination: this migration MUST be marked applied on staging
-- before the next db:migrate run on staging (same model as the initial-
-- schema migration). See 1-system-manual/staging-coordination/
-- 2026-04-22-initial-schema-mark-applied.sql for the combined script.
